## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

Immortelle Nuit keeps La Nuit's cool cardamom-lavender-cedar vertical intact, then adds a honeyed-dry immortelle afterglow. TARGET / IDEAL combines Immortelle Absolute, Helichrysum lift, hay, a restrained maple echo, and Nerol continuity. CURRENT keeps Immortelle Absolute, Maple Lactone, Nerol, and dry Tonkarome but omits Helichrysum and Hay pending their data gates. Tobacco, balsams, Neroli, extra musk, and every lost tincture are excluded. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-05.json`.

